Unit 7 keeps the same two-container shape but flips the direction. Instead of a sidecar helping the primary container do its job better, an ambassador sits in front of outgoing calls and reshapes them — which is how you add proxying, sharding, or experimentation without the primary container knowing any of it is happening. as unit 06

